ove a single meeting.","emphasis":true,"icon":"calendar","title":"One zoomable timeline"},"slots":{}},{"componentId":"land.feature-item","componentVersion":1,"id":"features-land-feature-item-5","props":{"body":"Layer any set of calendars and see shared free time highlighted, across time zones.","emphasis":false,"icon":"people","title":"Team overlay"},"slots":{}},{"componentId":"land.feature-item","componentVersion":1,"id":"features-land-feature-item-6","props":{"body":"Focus blocks show as busy to others and move out of the way when a real deadline needs the hour.","emphasis":false,"icon":"clock","title":"Protected focus"},"slots":{}},{"componentId":"land.feature-item","componentVersion":1,"id":"features-land-feature-item-7","props":{"body":"One summary before the day starts instead of a notification for every event.","emphasis":false,"icon":"bell","title":"Quiet reminders"},"slots":{}},{"componentId":"land.feature-item","componentVersion":1,"id":"features-land-feature-item-8","props":{"body":"Hours booked per person, per week. Spot the overloaded before the Friday crunch.","emphasis":false,"icon":"layers","title":"Workload view"},"slots":{}},{"componentId":"land.feature-item","componentVersion":1,"id":"features-land-feature-item-9","props":{"body":"Colleagues see busy, not details, unless you share them. Org adds SSO and an audit log.","emphasis":false,"icon":"lock","title":"Private by default"},"slots":{}}]}}]}},{"componentId":"land.section","componentVersion":1,"id":"features-land-section-10","props":{"anchor":"","band":false},"slots":{"content":[{"componentId":"land.split","componentVersion":1,"id":"features-land-split-11","props":{"ratio":"1/1","reverse":false},"slots":{"copy":[{"componentId":"land.section-heading","componentVersion":1,"id":"features-land-section-heading-13","props":{"align":"start","as":"h2","eyebrow":"Views","heading":"Move a block once, everywhere","intro":""},"slots":{}},{"componentId":"land.prose","componentVersion":1,"id":"features-land-prose-14","props":{"markdown":"Every view reads from the same week. Drag a planning session from Tuesday to Thursday in the week view and it moves in the month view, on your colleague's overlay and in the calendar app on their phone.\n\nNo copies, no duplicate invites, no \"which version is right?\""},"slots":{}}],"media":[{"componentId":"land.image","componentVersion":1,"id":"features-land-image-12","props":{"alt":"Three overlapping cards for day, week and month views connected by arrows","aspect":"16/10","src":"/uploaded-assets/asset-assets-c0782606-10cc-42f1-a223-ff461548f313"},"slots":{}}]}}]}},{"componentId":"land.cta-band","componentVersion":1,"id":"features-land-cta-band-15","props":{"buttonHref":"/#signup","buttonLabel":"Start free","heading":"Plan next week in ten minutes","lead":"Free for one person, forever. No card needed."},"slots":{}}],"schemaVersion":2},"id":"features","updatedAt":"2026-09-12T00:00:00.000Z"},{"createdAt":"2026-09-12T00:00:00.000Z","document":{"binding":{"outletId":"site-frame-outlet","sourceRecordId":"site-frame"},"id":"about-page","name":"About page","root":[{"componentId":"land.section","componentVersion":1,"id":"about-page-land-section-1","props":{"anchor":"","band":false},"slots":{"content":[{"componentId":"land.section-heading","componentVersion":1,"id":"about-heading","props":{"align":"start","as":"h1","eyebrow":"About","heading":"About Orrery","intro":""},"slots":{}},{"componentId":"land.split","componentVersion":1,"id":"about-page-land-split-2","props":{"ratio":"1/1","reverse":false},"slots":{"copy":[{"componentId":"land.prose","componentVersion":1,"id":"about-body","props":{"markdown":""},"slots":{}}],"media":[{"componentId":"land.image","componentVersion":1,"id":"about-page-land-image-3","props":{"alt":"Four abstract figures around a table beneath a large wall calendar","aspect":"4/3","src":"/uploaded-assets/asset-assets-55d857f5-fce8-4c86-827e-1de0a811a209"},"slots":{}}]}}]}},{"componentId":"land.section","componentVersion":1,"id":"about-page-land-section-4","props":{"anchor":"contact","band":false},"slots":{"content":[{"componentId":"land.section-heading","componentVersion":1,"id":"about-page-land-section-heading-5","props":{"align":"center","as":"h2","eyebrow":"Contact","heading":"Contact","intro":"Questions about Org, a partnership or a bug? We answer within one working day."},"slots":{}},{"componentId":"land.contact-form","componentVersion":1,"id":"about-page-land-contact-form-6","props":{"heading":"Write to us","successText":"Thanks — in this demo, your message was not sent anywhere."},"slots":{}},{"componentId":"land.demo-note","componentVersion":1,"id":"about-page-land-demo-note-7","props":{"text":"Demo — no data is sent."},"slots":{}}]}}],"schemaVersion":2},"id":"about-page","updatedAt":"2026-09-12T00:00:00.000Z"},{"createdAt":"2026-09-12T00:00:00.000Z","document":{"binding":{"outletId":"site-frame-outlet","sourceRecordId":"site-frame"},"id":"privacy","name":"Privacy","root":[{"componentId":"land.section","componentVersion":1,"id":"privacy-land-section-1","props":{"anchor":"","band":false},"slots":{"content":[{"componentId":"land.container","componentVersion":1,"id":"privacy-land-container-2","props":{"width":"narrow"},"slots":{"content":[{"componentId":"land.section-heading","componentVersion":1,"id":"privacy-land-section-heading-3","props":{"align":"start","as":"h1","eyebrow":"Legal","heading":"Privacy","intro":"Last updated 1 September 2026."},"slots":{}},{"componentId":"land.prose","componentVersion":1,"id":"privacy-land-prose-4","props":{"markdown":"Orrery is a fictional product, and this is a demo site. Nothing you type on it leaves your browser: the signup and contact forms only pretend to send.\n\n## What a real Orrery would collect\n\n- Your name and work email, to create your account.\n- Calendar events you connect, to show them in your week. We read titles and times; attachments stay where they are.\n- Billing details, handled by our payment processor. We never see full card numbers.\n\n## What we would never do\n\n- Sell your data or show you advertising.\n- Read the content of events you mark private.\n- Keep your data after you delete your workspace. Deletion finishes within 30 days.\n\n## Contact\n\nQuestions about privacy go to the [contact form](/about), which, on this demo, sends nothing."},"slots":{}}]}}]}}],"schemaVersion":2},"id":"privacy","updatedAt":"2026-09-12T00:00:00.000Z"},{"createdAt":"2026-09-12T00:00:00.000Z","document":{"binding":{"outletId":"site-frame-outlet","sourceRecordId":"site-frame"},"id":"terms","name":"Terms","root":[{"componentId":"land.section","componentVersion":1,"id":"terms-land-section-1","props":{"anchor":"","band":false},"slots":{"content":[{"componentId":"land.container","componentVersion":1,"id":"terms-land-container-2","props":{"width":"narrow"},"slots":{"content":[{"componentId":"land.section-heading","componentVersion":1,"id":"terms-land-section-heading-3","props":{"align":"start","as":"h1","eyebrow":"Legal","heading":"Terms","intro":"Last updated 1 September 2026."},"slots":{}},{"componentId":"land.prose","componentVersion":1,"id":"terms-land-prose-4","props":{"markdown":"These terms describe a fictional service on a demo site. They are sample copy, not an offer or a contract.\n\n## Your account\n\nYou are responsible for the calendars you connect and for the people you invite. Keep your password to yourself; Org workspaces can require single sign-on instead.\n\n## Plans and billing\n\n- Solo is free. Studio and Org are billed per person, monthly or yearly.\n- Yearly plans are paid up front and cost about 20% less per month.\n- You can cancel at any time. Your plan runs to the end of the paid period.\n\n## Your data\n\nYour events stay yours. You can export everything at any time, and we delete it when you close the workspace.\n\n## Changes\n\nIf these terms change, we tell workspace owners by email 30 days before the change applies."},"slots":{}}]}}]}}],"schemaVersion":2},"id":"terms","updatedAt":"2026-09-12T00:00:00.000Z"}]}],"content":[{"entries":[{"createdAt":"2026-09-12T00:00:00.000Z","generation":0,"id":"tier-solo","lifecycle":"published","modelId":"tiers","schemaVersion":1,"updatedAt":"2026-09-12T00:00:00.000Z","values":{"tiers-cta-href":"/#signup","tiers-cta-label":"Start free","tiers-currency":"USD","tiers-feature1":"Day, week and month views","tiers-feature2":"Sync two calendars","tiers-feature3":"Focus blocks you set once","tiers-feature4":"Weekly plan email on Sunday","tiers-feature5":"","tiers-feature6":"","tiers-features":["Day, week and month views","Sync two calendars","Focus blocks you set once","Weekly plan email on Sunday"],"tiers-name":"Solo","tiers-order":1,"tiers-popular":false,"tiers-price-monthly":0,"tiers-price-yearly":0,"tiers-slug":"solo","tiers-tagline":"For one person planning their own week."}},{"createdAt":"2026-09-12T00:00:00.000Z","generation":0,"id":"tier-studio","lifecycle":"published","modelId":"tiers","schemaVersion":1,"updatedAt":"2026-09-12T00:00:00.000Z","values":{"tiers-cta-href":"/#signup","tiers-cta-label":"Start trial","tiers-currency":"USD","tiers-feature1":"Everything in Solo","tiers-feature2":"Shared team calendar","tiers-feature3":"Unlimited calendar sync","tiers-feature4":"Meeting slots that respect focus time","tiers-feature5":"Workload view per person","tiers-feature6":"14-day free trial","tiers-features":["Everything in Solo","Shared team calendar","Unlimited calendar sync","Meeting slots that respect focus time","Workload view per person","14-day free trial"],"tiers-name":"Studio","tiers-order":2,"tiers-popular":true,"tiers-price-monthly":12,"tiers-price-yearly":10,"tiers-slug":"studio","tiers-tagline":"For teams up to 25 who plan the week together."}},{"createdAt":"2026-09-12T00:00:00.000Z","generation":0,"id":"tier-org","lifecycle":"published","modelId":"tiers","schemaVersion":1,"updatedAt":"2026-09-12T00:00:00.000Z","values":{"tiers-cta-href":"/about","tiers-cta-label":"Talk to us","tiers-currency":"USD","tiers-feature1":"Everything in Studio","tiers-feature2":"Cross-team availability","tiers-feature3":"Single sign-on and SCIM","tiers-feature4":"Audit log with one-year history","tiers-feature5":"A named onboarding contact","tiers-feature6":"","tiers-features":["Everything in Studio","Cross-team availability","Single sign-on and SCIM","Audit log with one-year history","A named onboarding contact"],"tiers-name":"Org","tiers-order":3,"tiers-popular":false,"tiers-price-monthly":29,"tiers-price-yearly":24,"tiers-slug":"org","tiers-tagline":"For companies running many teams on one calendar."}},{"createdAt":"2026-09-12T00:00:00.000Z","generation":0,"id":"testimonial-mara","lifecycle":"published","modelId":"testimonials","schemaVersion":1,"updatedAt":"2026-09-12T00:00:00.000Z","values":{"testimonials-avatar":{"testimonials-avatar-alt":"Abstract geometric avatar in grey with a cobalt collar","testimonials-avatar-src":"/uploaded-assets/asset-assets-dc0233ae-9bc8-4a34-b641-e29785e46143"},"testimonials-name":"Mara Lind","testimonials-order":1,"testimonials-quote":"We used to spend Monday morning arguing about when to meet. Now the week is already on one screen when we sit down, and the argument never starts.","testimonials-role":"Operations lead, Quarto"}},{"createdAt":"2026-09-12T00:00:00.000Z","generation":0,"id":"testimonial-jonah","lifecycle":"published","modelId":"testimonials","schemaVersion":1,"updatedAt":"2026-09-12T00:00:00.000Z","values":{"testimonials-avatar":{"testimonials-avatar-alt":"Abstract geometric avatar on a cobalt disc","testimonials-avatar-src":"/uploaded-assets/asset-assets-97c31942-4c4e-4da3-a8d0-c7b0777b29fb"},"testimonials-name":"Jonah Reyes","testimonials-order":2,"testimonials-quote":"Focus blocks are the feature I didn't know I needed. Orrery keeps my mornings clear, and meetings land in the afternoon without anyone asking.","testimonials-role":"Staff engineer, Tessera"}},{"createdAt":"2026-09-12T00:00:00.000Z","generation":0,"id":"testimonial-priya","lifecycle":"published","modelId":"testimonials","schemaVersion":1,"updatedAt":"2026-09-12T00:00:00.000Z","values":{"testimonials-avatar":{"testimonials-avatar-alt":"Abstract geometric avatar with cobalt glasses","testimonials-avatar-src":"/uploaded-assets/asset-assets-ecb0692c-6286-4cd7-814b-f78f201357c4"},"testimonials-name":"Priya Natarajan","testimonials-order":3,"testimonials-quote":"Forty people across three time zones, and the workload view shows me who is overbooked before they tell me. Planning takes ten minutes instead of an hour.","testimonials-role":"Head of delivery, Brightwater"}},{"createdAt":"2026-09-12T00:00:00.000Z","generation":0,"id":"faq-calendars","lifecycle":"published","modelId":"faq","schemaVersion":1,"updatedAt":"2026-09-12T00:00:00.000Z","values":{"faq-answer":"Google Calendar, Microsoft 365 and any calendar that publishes an **iCal feed**. Events sync both ways within a minute.","faq-order":1,"faq-question":"Which calendars does Orrery work with?","faq-topic":"general"}},{"createdAt":"2026-09-12T00:00:00.000Z","generation":0,"id":"faq-replace","lifecycle":"published","modelId":"faq","schemaVersion":1,"updatedAt":"2026-09-12T00:00:00.000Z","values":{"faq-answer":"No. Orrery sits on top of the calendars you already use. Remove it and every event is still where it was.","faq-order":2,"faq-question":"Do we have to move off our current calendar?","faq-topic":"general"}},{"createdAt":"2026-09-12T00:00:00.000Z","generation":0,"id":"faq-focus","lifecycle":"published","modelId":"faq","schemaVersion":1,"updatedAt":"2026-09-12T00:00:00.000Z","values":{"faq-answer":"Pick the hours you want protected. Orrery marks them busy for everyone else and suggests meeting slots around them.","faq-order":3,"faq-question":"How do focus blocks work?","faq-topic":"general"}},{"createdAt":"2026-09-12T00:00:00.000Z","generation":0,"id":"faq-trial","lifecycle":"published","modelId":"faq","schemaVersion":1,"updatedAt":"2026-09-12T00:00:00.000Z","values":{"faq-answer":"Solo is free for as long as you like. Studio comes with a **14-day trial**, and no card is needed to start it.","faq-order":4,"faq-question":"Is there a free trial?","faq-topic":"billing"}},{"createdAt":"2026-09-12T00:00:00.000Z","generation":0,"id":"faq-yearly","lifecycle":"published","modelId":"faq","schemaVersion":1,"updatedAt":"2026-09-12T00:00:00.000Z","values":{"faq-answer":"Pay for twelve months up front and each month costs about 20% less: $10 instead of $12 on Studio, $24 instead of $29 on Org.","faq-order":5,"faq-question":"How does yearly billing work?","faq-topic":"billing"}},{"createdAt":"2026-09-12T00:00:00.000Z","generation":0,"id":"faq-seats","lifecycle":"published","modelId":"faq","schemaVersion":1,"updatedAt":"2026-09-12T00:00:00.000Z","values":{"faq-answer":"Seats are counted on the first of each month. Add people whenever you like; we charge the difference on the next invoice.","faq-order":6,"faq-question":"What happens when someone joins or leaves?","faq-topic":"billing"}},{"createdAt":"2026-09-12T00:00:00.000Z","generation":0,"id":"faq-cancel","lifecycle":"published","modelId":"faq","schemaVersion":1,"updatedAt":"2026-09-12T00:00:00.000Z","values":{"faq-answer":"Yes. Cancel from the billing page and your plan runs to the end of the period you paid for. Export your data first if you want a copy.","faq-order":7,"faq-question":"Can I cancel at any time?","faq-topic":"billing"}},{"createdAt":"2026-09-12T00:00:00.000Z","generation":0,"id":"faq-data","lifecycle":"published","modelId":"faq","schemaVersion":1,"updatedAt":"2026-09-12T00:00:00.000Z","values":{"faq-answer":"In the EU or the US — you choose when you create the workspace. Event details are encrypted at rest, and Org adds SSO and an audit log.","faq-order":8,"faq-question":"Where is our data stored?","faq-topic":"security"}},{"createdAt":"2026-09-12T00:00:00.000Z","generation":0,"id":"about-orrery","lifecycle":"published","modelId":"about","schemaVersion":1,"updatedAt":"2026-09-12T00:00:00.000Z","values":{"about-body":"## Why we started\n\nWe ran operations for teams that shipped on time and still lost Monday mornings to scheduling. The information was all there, split across five calendars and a spreadsheet nobody trusted.\n\nAn orrery is a model of the solar system: every part moving on its own orbit, and all of them visible at once. That is what we wanted for a team's week.\n\n## How we work\n\n- We are eleven people in Lisbon, Toronto and remote.\n- We plan our own week in Orrery, every Monday, in about ten minutes.\n- We ship small changes every week and write about them in the changelog.","about-heading":"We make the week legible","about-intro":"Orrery is a small team building one calendar for the people who have to make everyone else's calendar work."}}],"id":"content-filesystem","models":[{"createdAt":"2026-09-12T00:00:00.000Z","document":{"description":"Pricing tiers. `features` is the real list; feature1…6 are its flattened copy for the tier component.","fields":[{"id":"tiers-name","key":"name","kind":"text","label":"Name","required":true},{"id":"tiers-slug","key":"slug","kind":"slug","label":"Slug","required":true},{"id":"tiers-tagline","key":"tagline","kind":"text","label":"Tagline","required":true},{"id":"tiers-price-monthly","key":"priceMonthly","kind":"number","label":"Price per month","required":true},{"id":"tiers-price-yearly","key":"priceYearly","kind":"number","label":"Price per month, billed yearly","required":true},{"id":"tiers-currency","key":"currency","kind":"text","label":"Currency","required":true},{"id":"tiers-features","item":{"kind":"text"},"key":"features","kind":"list","label":"Features","required":true},{"id":"tiers-feature1","key":"feature1","kind":"text","label":"Feature1","required":false},{"id":"tiers-feature2","key":"feature2","kind":"text","label":"Feature2","required":false},{"id":"tiers-feature3","key":"feature3","kind":"text","label":"Feature3","required":false},{"id":"tiers-feature4","key":"fea